## api.open-meteo.com

Provides the current conditions, the 7 day daily forecast and the 3 day hourly series behind WEATHER_CHECK, WEATHER_FORECAST and STORM_ALERT. Every temperature, wind figure, rain amount and hazard verdict SkyWire returns comes from this API.

Licence: CC-BY-4.0. The licence page states "API data are offered under Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)".

Attribution is required. The licence page asks for a link "next to any location Open-Meteo data are displayed" and gives the anchor text "Weather data by Open-Meteo.com". CC BY 4.0 adds a link to the licence and an indication that changes were made. The line to publish:

> Weather data by Open-Meteo.com (https://open-meteo.com/), licensed under CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Values are rounded and rewritten as sentences by SkyWire.

Terms: https://open-meteo.com/en/terms
Licence: https://open-meteo.com/en/licence

## geocoding-api.open-meteo.com

Provides place name to latitude, longitude, country and timezone. It runs first on every request, since the forecast API takes coordinates.

Licence: CC-BY-4.0, under the same Open-Meteo licence page. The docs page credits its own source under "Attribution" as "Location data based on GeoNames".

Attribution is required. The line to publish:

